职","originalTitle":"","summary":"谷歌Android平台安全负责人René Mayrhofer辞职，他在5月18日内部告别信中指责公司“丧失道德指针”，批评谷歌悄悄放弃碳中和目标（因AI模型能耗），并与美国战争部签署允许AI用于“任何合法目的”的协议。今年4月下旬谷歌宣布向五角大楼提供AI用于机密工作，2025年2月更新AI原则时移除了不使用AI开发武器或监控工具的承诺。Mayrhofer担忧谷歌AI产品可能被用于针对公民的大规模监控，包括自己和家人。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqc5usi000cbslt49vfrpgge","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/888.htm","publishedAt":"2026-06-14T00:00:00.485Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqc5usi000cbslt49vfrpgge","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T00:49:01.043Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-11T00:49:01.043Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"谷歌Android平台安全负责人René Mayrhofer辞职，他在5月18日内部告别信中指责公司“丧失道德指针”，批评谷歌悄悄放弃碳中和目标（因AI模型能耗），并与美国战争部签署允许AI用于“任何合法目的”的协议。今年4月下旬谷歌宣布向五角大楼提供AI用于机密工作，2025年2月更新AI原则时移除了不使用AI开发武器或监控工具的承诺。Mayrhofer担忧谷歌AI产品可能被用于针对公民的大规模监控，包括自己和家人。","reportEdition":"2026-06-14","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqca4a1900uxsl9izm7hb426","title":"Anthropic 秘密申请上市，估值 9650 亿美元","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-06-14T00:00:00.485Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmqca4a1900uxsl9izm7hb426","https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-06-13/global-capitalism-bets-it-all-on-ai-future-that-alarms-voters"],"articles":[{"id":"cmqca4a1900uxsl9izm7hb4